      ],
      "note": "This is a full complex: a Seemannsclub, a Seemannshotel where seafarers (and tourists) can stay the night, the St. Clemens am Hafen chapel, and a garden. There's a memorial book for seafarers lost at sea, including the crew of the sailing ship Pamir. Meals at the hotel restaurant run roughly €10–20; the club has snacks and drinks.",
      "updated": "12 August 2026"
    },
